---
title: "T3 return: card waits, sweep receipts, origin must wake"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: stuck
    lg2: Breaks NoDeadlock or ParkedReceiptGetsWake
    lg3: Path to the NoDeadlock or ParkedReceiptGetsWake bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Run in flight
  s1: Run finished, sweep not yet seen
  s2: Receipt parked #8212; nobody is woken
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the T3 run ends
  s1 --> s2: sweep writes the return receipt
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
